 class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D457 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2260\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D714 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D457 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2260\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> be the\n<em>neighbours</em> of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> in the\ngraph of <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"prp-mvn-precision\">@prp-mvn-precision</span>, and let <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\bar{N}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.549em; margin-bottom: -0.544em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" style=\"width: 0; margin-left: -0.25em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cAF\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">¯</mo></mover></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> be the remaining indices.</p>\n<div class=\"enumerate\" data-options=\"label=(\\alph*)\">\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li><p>Show that <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"Y_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.182em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is\nconditionally independent of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Y}_{\\bar{N}}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D418 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.307em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.549em; margin-bottom: -0.544em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" style=\"width: 0; margin-left: -0.25em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cAF\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> given <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Y}_N\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D418 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Y</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. <em>Hint:</em> <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"thm-mvn-conditional\">@thm-mvn-conditional</span>(c)\nidentifies the precision matrix of the conditional distribution of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"(Y_i,\\mathbf{Y}_{\\bar{N}})\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.182em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D418 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.307em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.549em; margin-bottom: -0.544em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" style=\"width: 0; margin-left: -0.25em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cAF\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> given <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Y}_N\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D418 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Y</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> as a block of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol{\\Omega}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6C0 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Ω</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p></li>\n<li><p>Show conversely that if, for some set <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"N\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> not containing <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, the variable <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"Y_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.182em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is conditionally independent of all\nthe remaining entries given <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Y}_N\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D418 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Y</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>,\nthen <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\omega_{ij}=0\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D714 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D457 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ω</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> for every <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"j\\notin N\\cup\\{i\\}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D457 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2209\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>j</mi><mo>∉</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>∪</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. So the neighbourhood\nof (a) is the smallest such conditioning set.</p></li>\n<li><p>In a first-order autoregression, <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol{\\Omega}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6C0 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Ω</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is tridiagonal. What\ndoes (a) say about <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"Y_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.182em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and the past\nand future of the series?</p></li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch03-multivariate-normal/06-partial-correlation.html"}